  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. </li>\n• <li>Chop cauliflower (including stalk!) into small florets. </li>\n• <li>Slice brown onion into wedges.</li>\n• <li>Place cauliflower and onion on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and  season with salt. Toss to coat.</li>\n• <li>Roast until tender, 20-25 mins. </li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf451b1c7102b607e2060/step-378fc800.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Meanwhile, boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.</li>\n• <li>Cook fusilli in boiling water, over high heat, until ‘al dente’, 11 mins.</li>\n• <li>Reserve some pasta water (¼ cup for 2P / ½ cup for 4P), then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf451b1c7102b607e2060/step-d613a310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>When veggies are done, heat the butter and a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium heat.</li>\n• <li>Cook garlic &amp; herb spice blend and the plain flour until fragrant, 1 min.</li>\n• <li>Stir in cooking cream, the stock powder, milk and reserved pasta water. Simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 mins.</li>\n• <li>Add cooked pasta, roast veggies and baby spinach, stirring to combine.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf451b1c7102b607e2060/step-64a66720.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Preheat grill to high.</li>\n• <li>Transfer pasta to a baking dish. </li>\n• <li>Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese and grill until golden, 5-10 mins.</li>\n• <li>Divide cheesy cauliflower pasta bake between bowls. </li>\n• <li>Sprinkle with the chilli flakes (if using) to serve.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf451b1c7102b607e2060/step-88c7ae30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
